ecademy.com/catalog/language/bash" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase=
 e14vpv2g0">Bash course</a> before proceeding.</p>
<h3 id=3D"heading-mac-anaconda" class=3D"g-md-h3">Mac Anaconda</h3>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">Go to the <a target=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://www.anac=
onda.com/products/individual#Downloads" class=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-Ancho=
rBase e14vpv2g0" rel=3D"noopener">Anaconda Downloads page</a> and download =
the 64-bit Graphical Installer for Mac.</p>
<ol class=3D"g-md-ol">
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Double click on the .pkg file and click <kbd class=3D=
"g-md-kbd">Install</kbd>. </li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Read and agree to the licensing terms.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Select if you want to install for =E2=80=98Just Me=E2=
=80=99 or =E2=80=98All Users=E2=80=99. If you are installing for =E2=80=98A=
ll Users=E2=80=99, you must have 4. Administrator privileges.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">You will be prompted to select the installation locat=
ion. By default, Anaconda should try to install in your home directory. We =
recommend accepting this default. Click <kbd class=3D"g-md-kbd">Install</kb=
d>.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">You will be asked if you want to add Anaconda to your=
 PATH environment variable. Do not add Anaconda to the PATH because it can =
interfere with other software. </li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">You will be asked if you want Anaconda to be your def=
ault version of Python. We recommend =E2=80=98Yes=E2=80=99. There are some =
rare instances where you would not make Anaconda the default version, but t=
hey are beyond the scope of this article.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Click the <kbd class=3D"g-md-kbd">Install</kbd> butto=
n.</li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">You may be asked if you want to install PyCharm. PyCh=
arm is another IDE (similar to Jupyter Notebook), but it is not necessary r=
ight now. </li>
<li class=3D"g-md-li">Go ahead and finish the installation.</li>
</ol>
<h3 id=3D"heading-verify-anaconda-installation" class=3D"g-md-h3">Verify An=
aconda installation</h3>
<p class=3D"g-md-p">Now, you can verify your installation. Go to your Appli=
cations folder and double-click on Anaconda Navigator. </p>
