r operating system), click <kbd class=3D"g-md-kbd">Command</kbd> + <kbd cla=
ss=3D"g-md-kbd">Shift</kbd> and search for =E2=80=98Anaconda Navigator=E2=
=80=99. If you have to do this, we recommend manually creating a shortcut t=
o your Applications, Desktop, or any other folder you find convenient.</p>
