=3D"_blank" href=3D"https://docs.anaconda.com/free/navigator/overview/" cla=
ss=3D"g-md-a gamut-1r92bn9-AnchorBase e14vpv2g0" rel=3D"noopener">Anaconda =
Documentation</a>.</p>
<p class=3D"g-md-p"><img alt=3D"terminal showing possible local host urls f=
or running Jupyter Notebook" class=3D"g-md-img" src=3D"https://static-asset=
